      "text": "🚨NEW FOOTAGE: They used a blue light boat to stop the cameras\n\nTwo men on a small boat off Eastney.\n\nRNLI on the beach with the arrivals.\n\nOfficial boat moves in to push them back so they can’t film it.\n\nYou pay for the landing.\nYou pay for the coaches.\nYou pay for the boat that hides it.",
